      "cr": 0,
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Era sheet: Highsun 1, 955 BF, Peach's Castle.</em> Art and stats describe this figure on the night of the Day Of (events.json <code>highsun_1_955_bf_the_day_of</code>), not the present day of the campaign (1040 BF).</p><p>Pink-spotted cap, apron, candle and a ring of household keys. Non-combatant. She has turned down the Royal Suite tonight, walked past Luigi on the door, and may have heard something in the chimney.</p>",
        "public": ""
      }
